  "historyNote": "#8405, eff 8-2-05, (formerly Saf-C 1805.03); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14; amd by #12608, eff 8-22-18; ss by #13442, eff 8-29-22; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
